* A region's definitions, as DFHCSDUP lists them.
DEFINE TRANSACTION(CECI) GROUP(LOCAL)
       PROGRAM(DFHECIP) TASKDATALOC(ANY)
DEFINE TRANSACTION(PAY1) GROUP(PAYROLL)
       PROGRAM(PAYADM) CMDSEC(NO) RESSEC(NO)
DEFINE TRANSACTION(PAY2) GROUP(PAYROLL)
       PROGRAM(PAYRPT) CMDSEC(NO)
DEFINE TRANSACTION(PAY3) GROUP(PAYROLL)
       PROGRAM(PAYADM2) CMDSEC(YES)
